      "rcs-statistical-evidence": "<section id=\"rcs-statistical-evidence\" class=\"investigation-evidence\"><h2>Uniform allocations · formula sensitivity</h2><p>All 199 district-office lines receive one ₱4.2M budget unit, while their rainfall proxies span 1,564–4,045 mm/year (2.59×). Allocation coefficient of variation is 0%; rainfall-proxy variation is 19.1%. This establishes uniformity despite variable rainfall; it does not establish that planners ignored every factor.</p><svg class=\"evidence-graphic\" viewBox=\"0 0 950 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cumulative RCS budget units across offices ordered from lower to higher rainfall\"><path d=\"M60 45 V245 H890\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#536873\"/><text x=\"10\" y=\"55\">199</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"245\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\">1st office</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"265\">199th office</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"25\">Cumulative budget units · offices ordered by rainfall proxy</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#355b92\" stroke-width=\"3\" points=\"60.00,245.00 64.17,244.05 68.34,243.09 72.51,242.14 76.68,241.18 80.85,240.23 85.03,239.27 89.20,238.32 93.37,237.36 97.54,236.41 101.71,235.45 105.88,234.50 110.05,233.54 114.22,232.59 118.39,231.63 122.56,230.68 126.73,229.72 130.90,228.77 135.08,227.81 139.25,226.86 143.42,225.90 147.59,224.95 151.76,223.99 155.93,223.04 160.10,222.09 164.27,221.13 168.44,220.18 172.61,219.22 176.78,218.27 180.95,217.31 185.13,216.36 189.30,215.40 193.47,214.45 197.64,213.49 201.81,212.54 205.98,211.58 210.15,210.63 214.32,209.67 218.49,208.72 222.66,207.76 226.83,206.81 231.01,205.85 235.18,204.90 239.35,203.94 243.52,202.99 247.69,202.04 251.86,201.08 256.03,200.13 260.20,199.17 264.37,198.22 268.54,197.26 272.71,196.31 276.88,195.35 281.06,194.40 285.23,193.44 289.40,192.49 293.57,191.53 297.74,190.58 301.91,189.62 306.08,188.67 310.25,187.71 314.42,186.76 318.59,185.80 322.76,184.85 326.93,183.89 331.11,182.94 335.28,181.98 339.45,181.03 343.62,180.08 347.79,179.12 351.96,